      <description>NATCHITOCHES, LA. — The Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts (LSMSA) will host its annual Senior Recognition Ceremony and 42nd Commencement Exercises on Friday, May 15, and Saturday, May 16. Both events will be livestreamed, giving loved ones near and far the opportunity to share the occasion with the Class of 2026.</description>
                                                                                                                                                                                          
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
